1
00:00:06,427 --> 00:00:07,827
What's this?

2
00:00:07,827 --> 00:00:10,547
This is dark magic.

3
00:00:10,547 --> 00:00:12,067
Dark magic?

4
00:00:12,387 --> 00:00:15,127
Magic that turns people into demons with black Rukh.

5
00:00:15,127 --> 00:00:17,587
it is a terrible and very powerful magic.

6
00:00:18,047 --> 00:00:20,307
Why is this happening to them?

7
00:00:21,487 --> 00:00:24,087
This is a magic tool used to heal wounds.

8
00:00:27,847 --> 00:00:31,167
Stop making a mess of my dungeon!

9
00:00:31,167 --> 00:00:33,567
If it continues like this, they become demons for good!

10
00:00:33,567 --> 00:00:36,827
You should end this quickly with Baal's power!

11
00:00:37,767 --> 00:00:40,607
You're just a boy!

12
00:00:41,067 --> 00:00:42,777
He refused even after all we had done....

13
00:00:43,867 --> 00:00:45,657
Sinbad?

14
00:00:50,007 --> 00:00:51,037
Wha-What are you doing?

15
00:00:52,627 --> 00:00:55,117
I must save my friend.

16
00:00:56,287 --> 00:00:57,997
What are you talking about, dumb ass?

17
00:00:57,997 --> 00:01:00,567
If they become fully demon, we'll--

18
00:01:00,567 --> 00:01:01,497
Shut up.

19
00:01:02,387 --> 00:01:05,427
They said want to shape the world with me.

20
00:01:05,427 --> 00:01:07,887
You still think this monster is human?

21
00:01:07,887 --> 00:01:09,567
No!

22
00:01:09,567 --> 00:01:11,707
They are not man or monster.

23
00:01:12,167 --> 00:01:13,387
They are my comrades.

24
00:01:13,387 --> 00:01:16,147
I will not let my comrades die!

25
00:01:17,107 --> 00:01:19,267
You're always like this...

26
00:01:19,647 --> 00:01:21,707
You're not afraid ...?

27
00:01:21,707 --> 00:01:27,107
you cannot return to your country and you are searching...

28
00:01:27,107 --> 00:01:30,887
I don't follow my destiny.

29
00:01:31,617 --> 00:01:35,707
and so... I'm going to show that I can overcome my own destiny.

30
00:01:36,467 --> 00:01:39,917
Why do you fight to shape your destiny so much?

31
00:01:40,247 --> 00:01:42,927
How can you change it ?!

32
00:01:47,497 --> 00:01:50,917
2Nami Subs Presents: Magi: Sinbad no Bouken -Valefor Dungeon pt 2

33
00:02:00,647 --> 00:02:01,857
What's going on?

34
00:02:01,857 --> 00:02:03,477
This destructive power....

35
00:02:16,507 --> 00:02:19,127
What a time to break...

36
00:02:19,127 --> 00:02:21,377
Sinbad, use the power of the djinn!

37
00:02:22,027 --> 00:02:23,367
There is no other way!

38
00:02:23,367 --> 00:02:27,547
We either defeat them right now or we'll be killed!

39
00:02:27,547 --> 00:02:30,747
No, there is still another way.

40
00:02:30,747 --> 00:02:31,677
What?

41
00:02:31,677 --> 00:02:36,507
The monster's core is connected to the humans used to make it.

42
00:02:36,507 --> 00:02:39,807
and it seems like it's trying to drain their Magoi.

43
00:02:40,787 --> 00:02:43,107
The core of it is in the chest.

44
00:02:43,107 --> 00:02:47,817
If it can be destroyed with one blow, the three of them could be saved.

45
00:03:09,627 --> 00:03:10,217
Yes

46
00:03:12,217 --> 00:03:13,967
Bararaq-

47
00:03:14,147 --> 00:03:14,757
What?

48
00:03:27,507 --> 00:03:29,427
Hello, everyone.

49
00:03:29,847 --> 00:03:32,447
Without this, it seems you're powerless.

50
00:03:32,447 --> 00:03:34,447
The Falan witch!

51
00:03:38,227 --> 00:03:39,867
You're the one behind this!

52
00:03:42,287 --> 00:03:46,127
It's true, my real body is at Partevia.

53
00:03:46,127 --> 00:03:49,567
In fact, I'm under direct orders from Master Barbarossa.

54
00:03:49,567 --> 00:03:51,547
From my brother?

55
00:03:51,547 --> 00:03:54,347
Captain Dragul ...

56
00:03:54,347 --> 00:03:58,127
Pardon me, you were promoted two ranks again, you are now lieutenant.

57
00:03:58,127 --> 00:04:02,437
I climbed two ranks? What do you mean?

58
00:04:02,437 --> 00:04:07,287
This means you're already considered killed in action, Junior.

59
00:04:07,287 --> 00:04:08,227
That voice...

60
00:04:08,227 --> 00:04:09,787
Brother?

61
00:04:09,787 --> 00:04:13,847
Failed to conquer the dungeon, then ...

62
00:04:13,847 --> 00:04:17,237
... Failed to capture the dungeon conqueror, Sinbad.

63
00:04:17,237 --> 00:04:22,027
For someone of the famed Dragul family, this is unforgivable.

64
00:04:22,027 --> 00:04:23,247
And above all...

65
00:04:23,247 --> 00:04:25,447
... About my wife.

66
00:04:27,927 --> 00:04:34,127
Did you think I would not notice your feelings for Serendine?

67
00:04:35,707 --> 00:04:37,907
You crossed the line.

68
00:04:37,907 --> 00:04:40,067
She is my woman.

69
00:04:40,067 --> 00:04:43,387
Know your place, and die.

70
00:04:44,097 --> 00:04:47,517
You all were sent here as sacrificial pawns.

71
00:04:47,517 --> 00:04:50,227
You have nowhere to return to.

72
00:04:54,967 --> 00:04:56,237
Drakon.

73
00:04:59,227 --> 00:05:00,237
Hina!

74
00:05:02,587 --> 00:05:06,867
You should have immediately killed the demons with this sword.

75
00:05:07,827 --> 00:05:09,287
I told you already.

76
00:05:09,917 --> 00:05:11,747
I am not going to...

77
00:05:12,547 --> 00:05:14,087
... abandon anyone!

78
00:05:20,307 --> 00:05:21,757
Sinbad ...

79
00:05:22,147 --> 00:05:27,647
You always have been, overcome anything with a strong determination.

80
00:05:28,567 --> 00:05:33,427
I think if I had the power of a king, I could be like you.

81
00:05:33,727 --> 00:05:35,847
But now I understand.

82
00:05:35,847 --> 00:05:40,067
Even if I obtained the power of the king, I could not be like you.

83
00:05:40,067 --> 00:05:44,697
I'm just looking for an excuse to avoid mistakes.

84
00:05:45,407 --> 00:05:47,707
That's enough, Sinbad.

85
00:05:50,827 --> 00:05:52,497
I told you already ...

86
00:05:54,147 --> 00:05:56,877
... that's enough!

87
00:05:58,647 --> 00:05:59,507
Hina.

88
00:05:59,867 --> 00:06:03,637
Every time you're around, I end up getting my ass kicked.

89
00:06:04,327 --> 00:06:07,587
You're always underestimating me.

90
00:06:07,947 --> 00:06:10,627
When fighting the rampaging unicorn, you finished it off.

91
00:06:10,907 --> 00:06:13,987
You beat my opponents without even considering me.

92
00:06:14,547 --> 00:06:15,777
Even now ...

93
00:06:16,247 --> 00:06:19,767
My body is broken and  bruised

94
00:06:21,647 --> 00:06:23,047
But ...

95
00:06:23,827 --> 00:06:26,657
... You're an amazing guy.

96
00:06:26,657 --> 00:06:27,987
Yes.

97
00:06:29,527 --> 00:06:33,837
My destiny is to follow someone like him.

98
00:06:33,837 --> 00:06:36,387
Sin, I'll defeat him!

99
00:06:36,387 --> 00:06:39,467
I am the only one who can finish him off!

100
00:06:40,207 --> 00:06:44,677
Then, I'll keep him busy.

101
00:06:46,367 --> 00:06:48,887
With this I can get a direct hit!

102
00:06:49,767 --> 00:06:52,517
They are really annoying.

103
00:06:59,817 --> 00:07:00,567
What?

104
00:07:00,967 --> 00:07:04,487
This boy, he's somehow avoiding all the attacks!

105
00:07:04,487 --> 00:07:07,607
It's as if he can predict the attacks!

106
00:07:07,967 --> 00:07:08,447
In that case...

107
00:07:11,707 --> 00:07:12,917
Sinbad!

108
00:07:13,847 --> 00:07:15,497
Don't worry about me...

109
00:07:15,867 --> 00:07:16,917
But ...

110
00:07:16,917 --> 00:07:20,417
Do not move, we only have one shot at this!

111
00:07:22,087 --> 00:07:24,847
This need of yours to help others will get you killed.

112
00:07:27,887 --> 00:07:28,767
Die!

113
00:07:34,307 --> 00:07:35,187
Drakon.

114
00:07:38,007 --> 00:07:40,687
i was fighting for my country all this time.

115
00:07:40,687 --> 00:07:44,277
I used to think it was honorable, to die in battle for my country.

116
00:07:44,607 --> 00:07:46,407
But I was wrong.

117
00:07:46,707 --> 00:07:48,907
Who I should protect ...

118
00:07:49,267 --> 00:07:50,497
If you die, I will never forgive you!

119
00:07:50,987 --> 00:07:52,327
Barbarossa.

120
00:07:52,327 --> 00:07:54,497
I will not leave her to you!

121
00:07:54,497 --> 00:07:57,997
I will emerge from this dungeon, and...

122
00:07:57,997 --> 00:08:00,837
... Definitely will come to kill you!

123
00:08:03,927 --> 00:08:05,707
You come to your senses!

124
00:08:05,707 --> 00:08:08,807
Do you not see how shameful this is..

125
00:08:09,207 --> 00:08:10,977
... being under control of their magic?!

126
00:08:19,067 --> 00:08:21,857
What is going on?

127
00:08:29,507 --> 00:08:30,867
Sorry for keeping you waiting!

128
00:08:31,127 --> 00:08:35,367
This is the "First Spear" from the Imuchakk tribe!

129
00:08:35,617 --> 00:08:38,287
I'm not the old me.

130
00:08:38,707 --> 00:08:40,707
I am now sure ...

131
00:08:44,967 --> 00:08:46,587
... this will finish it!

132
00:09:00,287 --> 00:09:03,357
God damn it! How dare you kill my monster!

133
00:09:03,607 --> 00:09:05,357
You should join it!

134
00:09:10,527 --> 00:09:12,497
I believe this is mine.

135
00:09:18,467 --> 00:09:20,877
Still breathing, it seems he survived.

136
00:09:23,327 --> 00:09:24,807
You're awake?

137
00:09:26,787 --> 00:09:27,687
Oi.

138
00:09:28,267 --> 00:09:31,627
Sinbad, you saved us.

139
00:09:31,907 --> 00:09:33,177
Are you okay?

140
00:09:33,687 --> 00:09:38,927
Yes, I feel calm, as if an evil spirit had been separated from my body.

141
00:09:38,927 --> 00:09:41,067
Evil spirit??

142
00:09:42,567 --> 00:09:43,567
What?!

143
00:09:49,327 --> 00:09:50,927
Black rukh again...

144
00:09:50,927 --> 00:09:51,807
Boss!

145
00:09:51,807 --> 00:09:52,907
Impossible.

146
00:09:55,687 --> 00:09:57,357
The demon ...

147
00:09:57,357 --> 00:09:59,337
revived?!

148
00:10:01,877 --> 00:10:06,487
I can recreate it using a human corpse

149
00:10:06,487 --> 00:10:10,887
Plus, this child is already almost dead.

150
00:10:10,887 --> 00:10:13,967
These conditions are perfect for the finished core.

151
00:10:13,967 --> 00:10:16,747
What? Did they say "almost dead"?

152
00:10:16,747 --> 00:10:20,267
This time, the core is the child himself.

153
00:10:20,267 --> 00:10:26,187
Meaning to defeat the monster, you have to kill this child.

154
00:10:26,187 --> 00:10:28,447
Well, will you do?

155
00:10:34,347 --> 00:10:37,197
oi, what do you going to do?

156
00:10:37,197 --> 00:10:39,827
Maybe...

157
00:10:45,247 --> 00:10:48,087
He is trying to save him from inside?!

158
00:10:48,087 --> 00:10:51,527
Stop, the human body can not survive!

159
00:11:06,977 --> 00:11:08,847
What is this?

160
00:11:09,787 --> 00:11:12,167
It feels like it's flowing into my mind

161
00:11:13,787 --> 00:11:16,187
It is the memory of this child.

162
00:11:16,187 --> 00:11:20,327
Now we will go to the subconscious.

163
00:11:20,327 --> 00:11:21,287
Baal?

164
00:11:22,987 --> 00:11:27,627
My lord, I beg of you, save this child.

165
00:11:27,627 --> 00:11:32,587
He will not be able to return from the darkness that remains in this condition.

166
00:11:47,147 --> 00:11:49,027
It hurts...

167
00:11:49,727 --> 00:11:51,307
I don't want this...

168
00:11:53,047 --> 00:11:57,487
Mom ... Dad ...

169
00:12:02,807 --> 00:12:04,907
Where are you?

170
00:12:06,247 --> 00:12:07,417
Oi.

171
00:12:07,417 --> 00:12:11,547
Stop your whining, you're getting on my nerves!

172
00:12:13,207 --> 00:12:18,267
I don't wanna be here. I want to go home.

173
00:12:18,267 --> 00:12:20,747
Home? Do you even have a home?

174
00:12:20,747 --> 00:12:22,987
Quit being a fucking crybaby and face the music.

175
00:12:23,927 --> 00:12:28,647
We killed mother and father!

176
00:12:30,587 --> 00:12:32,527
Kill them, Jafar.

177
00:12:33,027 --> 00:12:34,027
Kill!

178
00:12:35,067 --> 00:12:38,267
We were born into the organization.

179
00:12:38,267 --> 00:12:41,427
One day,  we were required to kill them.

180
00:12:41,427 --> 00:12:44,917
So survive, we need to be strong!

181
00:12:48,107 --> 00:12:51,227
We had no other choice!

182
00:12:52,287 --> 00:12:53,797
There is no other choice...

183
00:12:56,387 --> 00:12:58,287
We had to kill them...

184
00:12:58,287 --> 00:13:01,087
we have to stay alive!

185
00:13:10,187 --> 00:13:13,817
So this is the real you.

186
00:13:14,807 --> 00:13:21,187
With this conflict in your heart, you're lying to yourself, and living in misery, huh?

187
00:13:21,187 --> 00:13:24,457
Shut up! What do you know ?!

188
00:13:25,807 --> 00:13:28,827
You're right, I do not know anything.

189
00:13:29,467 --> 00:13:30,287
But ...

190
00:13:33,507 --> 00:13:36,467
If you've got no place to go, I'll give you one.

191
00:13:37,027 --> 00:13:40,007
I will be the way by which you can keep moving.

192
00:13:40,007 --> 00:13:42,467
So do not lie to yourself anymore.

193
00:13:43,027 --> 00:13:44,977
Because in the end ...

194
00:13:45,907 --> 00:13:48,027
... you found your place.

195
00:13:56,767 --> 00:13:59,817
You heard me, didn't you?! I will not let my comrades die!

196
00:13:59,817 --> 00:14:03,197
Therefore, will not forgive you if you're dead.

197
00:14:05,907 --> 00:14:09,207
Huh? He received his own attack himself?

198
00:14:10,457 --> 00:14:11,457
Look!

199
00:14:12,027 --> 00:14:15,207
Black rukh is coming out of his body.!

200
00:14:19,747 --> 00:14:24,177
Not yet ... Do not give up yet, Jafar!

201
00:14:55,347 --> 00:14:57,927
Hey ...are you still alive?

202
00:15:00,747 --> 00:15:02,217
Yes.

203
00:15:04,217 --> 00:15:07,487
You really did it!

204
00:15:11,447 --> 00:15:13,687
I can not believe ...

205
00:15:13,687 --> 00:15:17,477
he could rescue people who fall into darkness.

206
00:15:17,477 --> 00:15:19,987
This boy...

207
00:15:25,607 --> 00:15:27,907
This treasure room ...

208
00:15:27,907 --> 00:15:33,497
is the place where the Djinn Valefor  will establish a contract with the King's Vessel.

209
00:15:33,497 --> 00:15:36,727
Well then, Choose who will become king!

210
00:15:43,327 --> 00:15:45,507
Sinbad, you're up!

211
00:15:46,867 --> 00:15:48,267
Hina.

212
00:15:48,667 --> 00:15:53,027
All the people here recognize you as king.

213
00:15:58,187 --> 00:16:02,527
Establish the contract with the Djinn, Sinbad, our king!

214
00:16:07,787 --> 00:16:12,427
I accept you as the king!

215
00:16:15,957 --> 00:16:18,237
Sixth Dungeon: Valefor

216
00:16:18,297 --> 00:16:21,407
Conquered!

217
00:16:32,167 --> 00:16:33,937
Looks like we're back.

218
00:16:34,867 --> 00:16:37,187
This time everything is in one place, yes.

219
00:16:37,707 --> 00:16:39,027
Very weird...

220
00:16:39,377 --> 00:16:42,287
Only a little time has passed since we entered the dungeon, however....

221
00:16:42,767 --> 00:16:45,547
it feels like ages ago.

222
00:16:45,947 --> 00:16:48,197
Welcome back!

223
00:16:59,467 --> 00:17:00,627
Father.

224
00:17:01,967 --> 00:17:02,967
I ...

225
00:17:04,587 --> 00:17:07,217
Well, let's go back to the village.

226
00:17:07,217 --> 00:17:09,487
The ceremony is about to begin!

227
00:17:11,207 --> 00:17:13,847
I will take leave from here.

228
00:17:13,847 --> 00:17:15,887
Wait, Drakon!

229
00:17:18,707 --> 00:17:21,607
Ultimately, we are rivals.

230
00:17:21,607 --> 00:17:24,607
Although we were allies in the dungeon,

231
00:17:24,607 --> 00:17:27,737
I have no reason to go with you.

232
00:17:29,607 --> 00:17:31,247
Why are you looking at me like that?!

233
00:17:31,247 --> 00:17:33,367
Nothing, no reason.

234
00:17:35,027 --> 00:17:36,747
You're not being sincere.

235
00:17:36,747 --> 00:17:40,367
Anyway, I'm going back to my country

236
00:17:40,367 --> 00:17:42,587
I am aware that it'll be dangerous.

237
00:17:42,587 --> 00:17:44,507
But despite everything in this place...

238
00:17:45,267 --> 00:17:47,757
... There is someone I have to protect.

239
00:17:49,907 --> 00:17:52,757
I understand. Good luck!

240
00:17:54,447 --> 00:17:57,017
Hopefully we do meet again.

241
00:18:06,187 --> 00:18:08,327
Sinbad ...

242
00:18:08,327 --> 00:18:12,327
If I were a man without a country, I would follow you as my king.

243
00:18:13,887 --> 00:18:15,737
No...I'd better not..

244
00:18:15,737 --> 00:18:19,327
Because if he is my master, my life would be full of problems.

245
00:18:21,947 --> 00:18:27,567
Kinzoku...It is an instrument that shines for Warriors...

246
00:18:27,567 --> 00:18:32,267
that have been blessed by the King and the djinn

247
00:18:33,067 --> 00:18:38,047
Drakon is the first to get this power.

248
00:18:38,047 --> 00:18:44,687
However, the story that uses this power is still there in the future.

249
00:18:47,107 --> 00:18:49,357
Yes, let's go home!

250
00:18:49,357 --> 00:18:51,367
Yeah!

251
00:18:58,307 --> 00:19:02,497
You are now a proud Imuchakk warrior,

252
00:19:02,497 --> 00:19:06,967
As evidence of this, I will now give you something special.

253
00:19:06,967 --> 00:19:09,027
Come close, warrior.

254
00:19:13,717 --> 00:19:18,187
Raging Unicorn horn is proof you're a warrior.

255
00:19:18,187 --> 00:19:22,147
This weapon is the symbol of justice.

256
00:19:22,147 --> 00:19:26,397
May your will be as strong as a million warriors.

257
00:19:26,397 --> 00:19:29,397
Warrior, your name is Hinahoho.

258
00:19:32,167 --> 00:19:41,167
The meaning of your new holy name is "clear like the ocean". Be an honorable warrior!

259
00:19:41,167 --> 00:19:42,667
Yes sir!

260
00:19:48,687 --> 00:19:49,667
Here.

261
00:19:56,647 --> 00:19:58,177
Boss.

262
00:19:58,177 --> 00:20:01,027
Cheers.

263
00:20:02,727 --> 00:20:04,367
Father!

264
00:20:06,187 --> 00:20:08,687
I mean, Elder.

265
00:20:09,187 --> 00:20:12,927
I will leave Imuchakk.

266
00:20:12,927 --> 00:20:16,697
I've decided...no, my destiny has decided

267
00:20:16,907 --> 00:20:20,657
To create a nation that unites the world!

268
00:20:21,507 --> 00:20:27,667
I want to be his sword, his hands, his shield. And achieve their dreams.

269
00:20:27,667 --> 00:20:32,067
I want to establish a new world along with Sinbad.

270
00:20:32,917 --> 00:20:35,927
You are now an Imuchakk warrior.

271
00:20:35,927 --> 00:20:37,887
I am proud of you.

272
00:20:38,947 --> 00:20:40,677
Yes.

273
